🐛 Describe the bug
mark_dynamic doesn't work on int because int is immutable and interned, so there's no way to say that it's "this int". We need some wrapper struct.
Simple implementation that requires manually unwrapping on the inside:
class DynamicInt:
  def __init__(self, x):
    self.tensor = torch.empty((0, x))
    torch._dynamo.mark_dynamic(self.tensor, 1)

  def __int__(self):
    return self.tensor.size(1)

